WEBVTT

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:07.370
Master, recently there have been lots of people illegally downloading television shows over the internet.

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:16.400
Without the rights-holders' permission, distribution via the internet or bootlegs is prohibited by law!

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.100
Please remember that!

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.750
...is this okay?

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:21.280
Once more!

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:28.790
Sorry for making everyone worry about me!

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:33.250
Plug Cryostat is back, at your service!

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:35.220
Welcome back!

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:36.490
Good to see you, Plug!

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:39.810
But it would have been better if you didn't come back.

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:44.400
How rude! And after all the blood, sweat and tears I've been through.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.710
Have your arms completely recovered?

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:50.230
Yeah, it shouldn't affect me going back to wor-

00:00:55.780 --> 00:01:01.400
Y-Yo! Long time no see... You didn't come for a visit after what happened...

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.710
A-Are you still angry?

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:15.870
What the hell was that about?!

00:01:15.870 --> 00:01:19.740
You think you can work with your arms like that?

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:23.870
No way, you still aren't finished with the rehab!

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:27.690
There's still two weeks before you're to be discharged from medical care.

00:01:27.690 --> 00:01:30.690
It's impossible to get out any earlier.

00:01:34.730 --> 00:01:39.070
Yeah, well, I wanted to return to work...

00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:42.370
Return to work...

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:45.040
You idiot!

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:51.000
Kiseki wa genjitsu no tonari ni aru

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:51.000
Miracles are right beside reality

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:54.090
Kanarazu aru

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:54.090
They're there for sure

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:05.440
Chiisana tameiki shinpai dakara

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:05.440
I heave a tiny sigh because I'm worried

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:11.350
Ushiro sugata mimamotteirunda yo

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:11.350
From behind you, I'm watching over you

00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:17.290
Kirai dattara konna koto iwanai yo

00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:17.290
I wouldn't be saying this if I hated you

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:23.470
Kitto hito wa hitori janai

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:23.470
I know it must be true that no man is an island

00:02:21.940 --> 00:02:24.880
Hitori janai

00:02:21.940 --> 00:02:24.880
You're not alone

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:31.150
Tatoeba sotto yubisaki ni fureru omoi

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:31.150
For example, if you gently brush those hopes with your fingertips

00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:37.090
Tatoeba taisetsu na toki wo wasurenaide

00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:37.090
For example, if you never forget these precious times

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:43.030
Kakato wo motto sukoshi dake takaku agete

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:43.030
I'll boost you up, just a little higher

00:02:43.310 --> 00:02:49.010
Mieru yo ano ko no hitomi ni utsuru hikari

00:02:43.310 --> 00:02:49.010
Look and see the light reflecting in her eyes

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:54.880
ENERGY wa sekai no zenbu ni michiteru

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:54.880
Filling up the whole world with energy

00:02:55.190 --> 00:03:02.670
Ima dake wa chikara wo kashite ageru yo

00:02:55.190 --> 00:03:02.670
Just for now, I'll lend my strength to you

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:19.590
So you're saying she's still unfit to work as of yet.

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:20.930
That's your assessment?

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:21.890
Yes.

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:27.020
I had a hunch she'd do something stupid again,
so I checked her condition with the chief physician.

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:29.020
Seriously, nosy cow...

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:36.190
Did you really think you could hide your pain in this condition?

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:43.410
Can you even do a desk job? Typing reports, data entry?

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:45.330
Nope, no way!

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:48.120
I still can't move my fingers freely.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:50.790
Then it's back to the hospital for you!

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:53.920
No! No! No! No! Definitely not!

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:56.290
You're not a child! Stop making this difficult!

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:59.630
You're the one who's been butting into things when you're not wanted!

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:58.590
What is it?

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:03.340
Captain Pulse, there will be an emergency meeting right after work.

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:02.340
Butting?! Excuse me for "butting" in on your stupid affairs!

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:04.970
What do you mean, "stupid?!" Shut up, you!

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:06.600
Emergency meeting? Hold on.

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:10.520
Shut the hell up!

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:20.490
Messing around and Kindness

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:20.490
Messing around and Kindness.

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:27.740
The Captain is too soft on you.

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:30.450
"Let her go through rehab while working," she says.

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:32.210
On the job training, right?

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:33.080
Wrong!

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:38.960
Anyway, let's get this over with.
You and I will work separately.

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:46.720
You'll go search for potential charging targets and lock onto them, then report back to me.

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:48.600
I'm sure you can handle that much.

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:51.180
Then, the charging?

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:52.270
I'll be doing it.

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:53.690
No way!

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:55.270
Your objections are moot.

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:19.130
This is the most efficient method.

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:20.960
Unacceptable!

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:23.210
Oh, just shut up.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:26.220
What was that?! You cold-blooded woman!

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:31.310
You're a jiggly breasted, panty peeing, four-eyed crybaby!

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:34.730
Then tell me what you can do with those two hands!

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:36.690
You can't even hold the refresher, can you?!

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:39.480
How's that? So now, got anything else to say?

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:42.940
Speechless, huh?

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:52.870
What?

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:58.580
If you don't do what you're told,
there'll be more where that came from.

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:00.000
Got it?

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:14.100
We're sending you signals that should boost your basic movements.

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:16.810
Not only does it make things easier,

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:20.100
it's much more efficient than starting from scratch. Well?

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:28.860
It does hurt a little, but it's definitely an improvement.

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:32.910
Hey, Doc. If I went back to work just to do some simple jobs...

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:34.540
Don't be absurd!

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:37.750
It takes most people half a year...

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:40.250
...just to get to the point where they can live normally.

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:44.170
While the regeneration process was successful, the cells in your arms are still new...

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:46.210
...and have yet to adapt.

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:48.800
That's why you need to wait.

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:55.470
Alright? Patients like you who force themselves to work...

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:02.730
Making myself work will actually make things worse, huh?

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:11.490
But I have no choice... I want to get back to work too badly...

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:15.450
Maybe seeing him is what I need.

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:19.500
He should be home by now...

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:24.540
Sentou!

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:33.510
Sentou!

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:35.760
Sentou!

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:38.980
Sentou!

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:43.690
Come on, if you dare!

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:58.040
Silica's breasts have completely disappeared!

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:02.120
Oh my god! Her being a busty magical broad was a fraud!

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:06.840
You... saw... me... didn't... you?!

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:15.510
<i>Where did you go, Sentou?</i>

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:24.520
Guess we don't have a choice, let's call a truce.

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:27.690
Yes, let's fight together and beat that monster.

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:39.620
I just got back from shopping...

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.330
Sentou!

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:44.710
Don't you know you're not supposed to barge in here?

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:45.920
No, wait!

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:50.170
It's been a while, but I'm sure my friend here wants some action!

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:00.100
Hey, did something happen to you?

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:14.110
In the end, I managed to charge the class Z kid back to normal.

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:16.160
I'm going to school tomorrow!

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:22.660
Anyway, I've finally managed to return to work today!

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:24.750
I was absent for a long while!

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:31.300
You think I'm a moron, right?

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:32.670
Well, yeah.

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:37.720
<i>Maybe it was a mistake to come here and have him cheer me up.</i>

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.020
Sentou?

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:45.190
Plug.

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:46.230
Yeah?

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:49.980
The bed I'm sitting on right now; can you touch it?

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:55.320
Yeah, why?

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:57.660
Take off your clothes and come here.

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:16.340
I-Idiot! Don't get the wrong idea!

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:19.300
It can't be... we're not ready for this yet!

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:22.260
That's not it! Just take off your jacket, alright?!

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:33.440
Rehab in our world is pretty much the same as in yours.

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:40.030
If you were just going to give me a massage,
you could have said so... and why do it on the bed?

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:43.620
Because this way I get to sit.

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:46.450
Fine then, it's no big deal.

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:50.120
Liar. Your palms are sweating.

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:52.340
I-It's only because your hands are warm!

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:55.340
Well, sorry about that.

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:04.310
But...

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:10.600
The doctor did say they work better while warm...

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:13.820
I see.

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:27.370
The pain has stopped; I can lift my arms up now!

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:29.790
Thank you! I'm so glad!

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:34.250
Don't overwork yourself from now on.

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:39.800
<i>Sentou... he seems a little different today.</i>

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:46.760
<i>It's sort of strange...</i>

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:50.520
Hey, look at that! Look, over there!

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:52.150
<i>He's giving me massages, and he's caring for me... Maybe it's because I'm hurt?</i>

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:54.190
You have to look! Hey, are you listening? Hey, you!

00:11:52.150 --> 00:11:55.150
<i>That must be it, he's being nice because of my injury.</i>

00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:01.240
How long are you going to keep on daydreaming?!

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:05.950
That middle schooler down there is acting strangely.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:07.790
Who is?

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:11.000
That one, isn't he a charging target?

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:18.760
He is?

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:26.470
Let's eat together.

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:31.430
Where are you staring at?

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:32.440
Over here.

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:38.400
Charge!

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:49.990
Everything seems to be going well.

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:54.370
I think I'll take a well-deserved break.

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:58.040
Come to think of it, his place is around here...

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:00.340
Well, it's not like I want to visit him.

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:04.050
Good afternoon!

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:07.260
He's not here...

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:12.020
Well, I guess this was expected...

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:14.890
Sentou!

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:17.480
Welcome back!

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:18.310
Alesta!

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:24.110
You're all mine, Sentou.

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:26.870
I've dreamed for this moment to come.

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:30.410
You're Alesta, right?

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:34.750
I might not be so honest most of the time...

00:13:37.130 --> 00:13:43.300
But I assure you, this is the real me.

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:45.380
Kiss me.

00:13:59.110 --> 00:14:02.730
I guess Sentou's still out...

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:09.160
He's a target?

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:10.240
Probably.

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:12.160
But Sentou, that's amazing.

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:15.910
You can tell whether he's a target by just looking.

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:19.420
I learned a thing or two from that competition with Alesta.

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:32.390
Well, the depression level is...

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:43.610
Here you go.

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:45.740
Sorry.

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:48.820
Damn it! We lost him!

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:57.710
<i>Sentou.</i>

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:00.170
There he is!

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:02.290
Bingo!

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:05.460
Good, then let the charging begin.

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:09.380
What's the matter?

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:12.640
I have to send Alesta the location...

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:15.770
...because I can't use my arms.

00:15:15.770 --> 00:15:17.850
If a target is found,

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:20.230
the charging will be left to Alesta.

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:22.610
That was the plan for today.

00:15:27.490 --> 00:15:29.780
Just a little more...

00:15:29.780 --> 00:15:30.700
Hey.

00:15:31.870 --> 00:15:35.660
You're letting somebody else do it...

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:37.500
Is it alright like that?

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:52.220
As I thought, it isn't because you're kind, Sentou.

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:55.430
You just told me to not overwork myself.

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:59.310
Overworking means working so hard you lose your arms, right?

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:28.840
Timing?

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:31.260
Even if I charge him now...

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:33.470
...I'm afraid it won't make a difference.

00:16:35.350 --> 00:16:37.600
That's why timing is everything.

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:40.730
Only when the emotions begin to improve...

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:42.850
...or when the heart wants something to change...

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:44.650
...will the charging...

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:48.570
...cause the subject to genuinely want to improve their current situation.

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:52.360
Alright, I got it.

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:53.110
Sentou?

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:55.110
Rather than waiting for it...

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:57.240
Wouldn't creating the right moment be easier?

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:02.120
Sentou, what are you trying to do?

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:09.210
You like girls with big boobs too, don't you?

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:12.340
Some busty, older girl, right?

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:14.720
If one approached you, wouldn't that just make your day?

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:18.100
You're such a pervert.

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:21.680
I can't stand it anymore.

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:23.850
What are you doing?

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:27.020
Have you come to a decision?

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:30.280
I trust you, Sentou.

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:34.700
These hands can't hold the refresher...

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:35.860
Don't hold back!

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:38.120
Sure.

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:52.670
You still should have held back!

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:02.890
Fight in one strike!

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:07.310
Charge!

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:31.340
I suddenly feel wonderful!

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:36.590
Thank goodness...

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:39.470
We did it, huh?

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:43.260
Yeah, we did it.

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:45.480
I was able to charge him.

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:48.140
I couldn't have done it without you, Sentou!

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:51.900
About that...

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:56.190
I got some bad news for you...

00:18:56.190 --> 00:18:57.950
The ground wire!

00:18:57.950 --> 00:18:59.610
I forgot to attach it again!

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:10.290
I know you told me the new suit was a failure, but this...

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:14.250
You... saw...?

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:19.760
Does that mean... the regular suits are no good, too?

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:39.650
I wanted to see Sentou...

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:45.990
Sentou, you idiot.

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:47.370
Plug!

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:53.960
Alesta.

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:56.000
Where have you been?

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:58.630
I didn't hear a single word from you.

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:01.010
Sorry about that.

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:03.850
Even though it was only one, I charged someone up.

00:20:03.850 --> 00:20:06.760
What? How'd you do it, in your condition?

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:12.770
Actually, I got Sentou to help.

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:18.320
<i>What's that? What's with that blushing face of yours?</i>

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:20.450
<i>Don't tell me, you got to...</i>

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:26.620
I got to juice up... a lot.

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:30.910
<i>And it was I who wanted to see Sentou so badly!</i>

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:32.750
<i>But this fool actually...</i>

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:36.540
Anyway, you ignored my orders!

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:38.340
You can't do that!

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:40.090
I already forgot them!

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:41.470
Y-You...

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:45.680
Being massaged by Sentou...

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:47.680
What a heavenly experience!

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:51.390
Unforgivable!

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:59.780
Why, you! You idiot!

00:20:57.570 --> 00:20:59.780
That hurts!

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:07.240
She's as much of a pain as always.

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:24.180
A dragonfly in the sunset.

00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:27.890
On whose behind did it finally land?

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:32.980
That was what Sentou Oumi was thinking at that moment.

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:35.560
I'm back, Brother!

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:39.190
What's wrong?

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:42.400
N-Nothing... at all!

00:21:57.710 --> 00:22:03.090
The green line represents the amount of electricity used in a normal charge.

00:22:05.430 --> 00:22:07.800
This is where the problem lies.

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:10.050
Unusually large amounts of electricity usage.

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:14.730
Even in the case of the class Z target,

00:22:14.730 --> 00:22:17.770
such large amounts of electricity shouldn't occur.

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:20.230
In addition to the two involved in this case,

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:24.490
there is one more person who cannot be ignored.

00:22:28.110 --> 00:22:32.700
We can't help but have... serious concern... over this issue.

