00:23:32.100 --> 00:23:33.820
Sore de nakya iya

00:23:32.100 --> 00:23:33.820
I couldn't stand it any other way

00:23:34.170 --> 00:23:37.640
Zettai watashi soba ni iru yo

00:23:34.170 --> 00:23:37.640
